 "stimulus_html": "For questions 2–4, use the following information:\n<blockquote>\nA computer costs $800. It loses <span data-math=\"\\frac14\">\\frac14</span> of its value every year after it is purchased.\n</blockquote>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\">\n  <li>Answer the following questions that would complete the table to show the value of the computer at the listed times.</li>\n</ol>",
